<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Many agencies reach a point where buying more data leads isn’t the problem.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">The challenge becomes how quickly those leads are worked, how consistently they’re followed up on, and how much producer time is being spent trying to make contact instead of having real sales conversations.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">EverQuote’s</span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://2287971.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2287971/2025%20LCS%201-Pager.pdf" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">Lead Connection Service (LCS)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> was built to address this exact challenge.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Our outreach specialists contact new leads within 30 seconds, continue nurturing across multiple touch points, and pass qualified prospects to your producers once they’re ready to engage.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">When agencies layer LCS on top of their data leads, they typically see around a 20% higher bind rate, along with better producer efficiency and stronger pipeline movement.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.44; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">If it would be helpful to walk through how this could fit into your current process, you’re welcome to </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://yoursage--unitedtech.sandbox.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/EmailTemplate/00XVm00000LFBn3MAH/%7B%7B%7BSender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c%7D%7D%7D" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">Book Time Here</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#181818"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

